title: DormHallway_Enter
---
<<if not flagged("hallway_intro")>>
    Dex: First night in the dorms. Big night out. Let's not blow it.
    <<flag hallway_intro>>
<<elseif flagged("signed_up")>>
    Dex: Name on the list. Hat on my conscience. Hallway, you've been good to me.
<<endif>>
===

title: Lacey_Look
---
<<if flagged("won_lacey")>>
    Dex: Lacey Rae, humming Hank Hollister and smiling. I did that.
<<elseif flagged("lacey_has_album") or flagged("lacey_has_drink")>>
    Dex: She's tapping her boot. Half impressed. One more thing and she's mine. For a dance.
<<else>>
    Dex: Cowboy boots, a sundress, and zero interest in me. Yet.
<<endif>>
===
title: Lacey_Talk
---
<<if not flagged("met_lacey")>>
    Lacey Rae: You lost, freshman?
    Dex: Only in your eyes.
    Lacey Rae: Cute. I only dance to real country, and this party is playing robot music.
    Lacey Rae: Bring me a decent song and a decent drink, then we'll talk.
    <<flag met_lacey>>
<<elseif flagged("signed_up")>>
    Lacey Rae: Word travels fast. You signed up for Speed Daters Live with MY hat?
    Dex: You said it was something to remember you by.
    Lacey Rae: I meant on a shelf, not on national TV. Fine. Win, and I get it back with interest.
<<elseif flagged("won_lacey")>>
    Lacey Rae: Still here, freshman? That dance was the best thing to happen at this party.
<<elseif flagged("lacey_has_album") and not flagged("lacey_has_drink")>>
    Lacey Rae: Hank's on, finally. Now I just need something to drink that isn't warm tap water.
<<elseif flagged("lacey_has_drink") and not flagged("lacey_has_album")>>
    Lacey Rae: Good drink. Bad music. Someone around here must own a real record.
<<else>>
    Lacey Rae: Song. Drink. I'm not asking for the moon, freshman.
<<endif>>
<<jump A1_Lacey_Menu>>
===
title: A1_Lacey_Menu
---
-> Ask what counts as real country <<if not flagged("lacey_has_album")>>
    Lacey Rae: Hank Hollister. Live. The album where he cries during the yodel and keeps going anyway.
    Dex: Who'd keep vinyl in a dorm?
    Lacey Rae: The guy in the bathrobe hasn't stopped bragging about his record collection all night.
    <<jump A1_Lacey_Menu>>
-> Ask what she wants to drink <<if not flagged("lacey_has_drink")>>
    Lacey Rae: Something with a little zing. There's a recipe card on the drinks table, genius.
    <<if flagged("a1_saw_no_soda")>>
        Dex: The table's out of soda.
        Lacey Rae: Then try the Union. Doreen keeps the last cold cans behind her counter like they're gold bars.
    <<endif>>
    <<jump A1_Lacey_Menu>>
-> Ask if she likes poetry <<if not flagged("a1_cb_me")>>
    Lacey Rae: Poets? Ugh. My ex was a poet.
    Lacey Rae: Boy knew forty thousand words, and the only one he ever used was "me".
    Dex: (Ooh. "The only one you ever use is 'me'." Filing that one away.)
    <<flag a1_cb_me>>
    <<jump A1_Lacey_Menu>>
-> Ask about her poet ex again <<if flagged("a1_cb_me")>>
    Lacey Rae: He wrote a sonnet about his own haircut. Fourteen lines. All about the left side.
    <<jump A1_Lacey_Menu>>
-> Ask about the hat <<if flagged("won_lacey")>>
    Lacey Rae: Keep it. Wear it somewhere people will see it.
    Dex: Like... on TV?
    Lacey Rae: Sure, slick. Like on TV.
    <<jump A1_Lacey_Menu>>
-> Ask for another dance <<if flagged("won_lacey")>>
    Lacey Rae: One dance is a memory. Two is a commitment. Go do something with that hat.
    <<jump A1_Lacey_Menu>>
-> Ask her to be your Talent Round partner <<if flagged("signed_up") and not flagged("won_ivy")>>
    Lacey Rae: Me, on a stage? I sing in the shower and the shower files complaints.
    Lacey Rae: Try the library. The quiet ones are always the brave ones. They just don't know it yet.
    <<jump A1_Lacey_Menu>>
-> Say goodnight
    Dex: Catch you later, Lacey Rae.
    Lacey Rae: Not if I catch you first, freshman.
===
title: Lacey_GiveAlbum
---
Lacey Rae: Is that... the Hank Hollister live album? Now we're talking.
<<take dance_album>>
<<flag lacey_has_album>>
<<jump Lacey_CheckWin>>
===
title: Lacey_GiveDrink
---
Lacey Rae: Lemon, soda, and a splash of something questionable. You're learning.
<<take hallway_hooch>>
<<flag lacey_has_drink>>
<<jump Lacey_CheckWin>>
===
title: A1_Lacey_GiveLemon
---
Lacey Rae: A lemon. Raw. You want me to just bite it, freshman?
Dex: The recipe card says lemon plus soda. I should put them together first.
===
title: A1_Lacey_GiveSoda
---
Lacey Rae: Plain soda? Where's the zing? Check that recipe card again.
===
title: Lacey_CheckWin
---
<<if flagged("lacey_has_album") and flagged("lacey_has_drink")>>
    Lacey Rae: Alright, freshman. One dance.
    Dex: Hank yodels. Lacey spins. I mostly try not to step on her boots. I step on her boots. She laughs anyway.
    Lacey Rae: Here. Something to remember me by.
    <<give cowboy_hat>>
    <<flag won_lacey>>
    Dex: Lacey Rae's own hat. If that isn't proof I'm a catch, nothing is. The sign-up sheet is in the lounge.
<<endif>>
===

title: Gil_Look
---
<<if flagged("gil_has_earplugs")>>
    Dex: Gil, finally at peace, earplugs in, swaying to a record only he can hear.
<<else>>
    Dex: A guy in a bathrobe, hiding from his own room like it's haunted.
<<endif>>
===
title: Gil_Talk
---
<<if not flagged("met_gil")>>
    Gil: Shh. Do you hear that? That's my roommate, Boomer. Snoring. At nine p.m. Through a closed door.
    Dex: Nice album collection, I hear.
    Gil: Get me through one night of sleep and you can borrow anything in my crate.
    <<flag met_gil>>
<<elseif flagged("gil_has_earplugs") and flagged("won_lacey")>>
    Gil: WHAT? Sorry, earplugs. Did the country album work?
    Dex: Like a charm. She danced with me.
    Gil: Hank Hollister, uniting people since 1974. Keep it. I'm going to sleep for a week.
<<elseif flagged("gil_has_earplugs")>>
    Gil: WHAT? Oh, it's you. Best purchase of my life.
<<else>>
    Gil: Still snoring. Still awake. The vending machine sells earplugs, but I'm broke.
<<endif>>
<<jump A1_Gil_Menu>>
===
title: A1_Gil_Menu
---
-> Ask about the snoring <<if not flagged("a1_boomer_moved")>>
    Gil: Boomer is a linebacker. He snores like a leaf blower. And he sleepwalks.
    Gil: Right now he's standing in the middle of our room, asleep, hugging the air. You never wake a sleepwalker.
    Gil: Last time someone woke him, he cried for an hour and then ate a lamp.
    <<jump A1_Gil_Menu>>
-> Ask about his records
    Gil: Crate by the bunk bed in room 216. Jazz, punk, polka, and one country album I won in a raffle.
    <<jump A1_Gil_Menu>>
-> Ask if you can go in his room <<if not flagged("gil_has_earplugs")>>
    Gil: My room is a war zone. Get me earplugs and my room is your room.
    <<jump A1_Gil_Menu>>
-> Ask how you move a sleepwalker <<if flagged("gil_has_earplugs") and not flagged("a1_boomer_moved")>>
    Gil: You don't push him. You lure him. Boomer follows food in his sleep.
    Gil: Last week he sleepwalked all the way to the Union because Doreen was making possum waffles.
    <<jump A1_Gil_Menu>>
-> Ask how he deals with show-offs <<if not flagged("a1_cb_pillow")>>
    Gil: Easy. Whenever Boomer brags about his bench press, I say "Cool story. Tell it to my pillow."
    Dex: (That's... not great. I'll keep it anyway. "Cool story. Tell it to my pillow.")
    <<flag a1_cb_pillow>>
    <<jump A1_Gil_Menu>>
-> Ask about Lacey Rae <<if flagged("met_lacey") and not flagged("won_lacey")>>
    Gil: The cowgirl by the corkboard? She's been glaring at the speakers all night. Robot music offends her.
    <<jump A1_Gil_Menu>>
-> Let him get some rest
    Gil: Rest. Ha. What a beautiful word.
===
title: Gil_GiveEarplugs
---
<<if flagged("gil_has_earplugs")>>
    Gil: I already have earplugs. I'm wearing them. WHAT?
<<else>>
    Gil: Earplugs! You beautiful man.
    <<take earplugs>>
    <<flag gil_has_earplugs>>
    Gil: Take the country one, I never liked it. It's in the crate in my room, 216. Door's open.
    Gil: Just... Boomer is standing in front of the crate. Sleepwalking. Do NOT wake him.
<<endif>>
===
title: A1_Gil_GiveAlarm
---
Gil: Is that Boomer's alarm clock? Get it away from me. It's set for five a.m. It says GAME DAY. It's always game day.
===
title: A1_Gil_GiveFreshener
---
Gil: Keep it. That tree already lost the war against Boomer's socks. Maybe it can win somewhere else.
===

title: A1_Door216_Look
---
Dex: Room 216. Through the door I can hear a snore like someone sawing a tuba in half.
===
title: A1_Door216_Use
---
<<if flagged("gil_has_earplugs")>>
    <<go gil_room from_hallway>>
<<elseif flagged("met_gil")>>
    Gil: Whoa, whoa. Nobody opens that door until I've got earplugs in. I can't take the full volume.
<<else>>
    Gil: Hey! That's my room. Unless you're here to stop the snoring, keep walking.
    <<flag met_gil>>
<<endif>>
===

title: A1_GilRoom_Enter
---
<<if not flagged("a1_gilroom_intro")>>
    Dex: Room 216. Records everywhere, a bunk bed, and a smell like a locker room had a baby with a sock drawer.
    Dex: And in the middle of it all, a giant in pyjamas, eyes shut, snoring on his feet. That must be Boomer.
    <<flag a1_gilroom_intro>>
<<endif>>
===
title: A1_GilDoor_Look
---
Dex: The door back to the hallway, and to air that doesn't taste like feet.
===
title: A1_GilDoor_Use
---
<<go dorm_hallway from_gil_room>>
===
title: A1_Bunk_Look
---
Dex: Bunk beds. Gil's on top, under a poster of a saxophone. Boomer's bunk is empty, because Boomer is busy sleepwalking.
===
title: A1_Bunk_Use
---
Dex: Lying down in a stranger's bunk while his roommate sleepwalks around me? That's a horror movie, not a nap.
===
title: A1_Crate_Look
---
Dex: A milk crate packed with vinyl. Gil has better taste in music than in bathrobes.
===
title: A1_Crate_Use
---
<<if flagged("a1_took_album") or flagged("lacey_has_album")>>
    Dex: I've got the only record I need. The rest is polka. So much polka.
<<elseif not flagged("a1_boomer_moved")>>
    Dex: Boomer is planted right in front of the crate, hugging the air. If I reach past him, he hugs me.
    Dex: I've seen him. That hug ends careers. I need to get him to move. Without waking him.
<<else>>
    Dex: Jazz, punk, polka, polka, polka... Hank Hollister, Live at the Grand Ole Barn. Bingo.
    <<give dance_album>>
    <<flag a1_took_album>>
<<endif>>
===
title: A1_Turntable_Look
---
Dex: Gil's turntable. It costs more than my entire wardrobe. Admittedly, my wardrobe is mostly this shirt.
===
title: A1_Turntable_Use
---
Dex: If I touch Gil's turntable, Gil touches my face. With his fist. Hands off.
===
title: A1_Turntable_Album
---
Dex: Playing it in here would only serenade a sleepwalker. Lacey's the one who needs to hear it.
===
title: A1_Alarm_Look
---
Dex: A huge red alarm clock with two bells on top. The label says GAME DAY. It's set for five a.m.
===
title: A1_Alarm_Use
---
Dex: If this goes off next to Boomer, he wakes up mid-sleepwalk. I'd better take it far, far away. For his own good.
Dex: It's loud, it's portable, and it's ticking. Somebody, somewhere, will want this.
<<give boomer_alarm>>
<<flag a1_took_alarm>>
===
title: A1_Freshener_Look
---
Dex: A pine tree air freshener on the window latch. "Alpine Morning." It never stood a chance.
===
title: A1_Freshener_Use
---
Dex: One slightly defeated pine tree. It still smells like a forest, if you put it right up your nose.
<<give pine_freshener>>
<<flag a1_took_freshener>>
===

title: A1_Boomer_Look
---
<<if flagged("a1_boomer_moved")>>
    Dex: Boomer, asleep on his feet next to the couch, chewing waffle in his sleep. Living the dream. Literally.
<<else>>
    Dex: Boomer. Six and a half feet of linebacker in a nightcap, eyes shut, slowly hugging the air.
<<endif>>
===
title: A1_Boomer_Talk
---
<<if flagged("a1_boomer_moved")>>
    Boomer: (chewing) Mmm. Possum. Best waffle. Tell Coach... I'm full.
<<else>>
    Boomer: (snore) Hhhnnnk... shoo... hhhnnnk...
    Dex: (whispering) Hi, Boomer. Don't mind me.
<<endif>>
<<jump A1_Boomer_Menu>>
===
title: A1_Boomer_Menu
---
-> Ask who he is
    Boomer: Mmmf. Boomer. Linebacker. Second string. Mom says first string in her heart.
    <<jump A1_Boomer_Menu>>
-> Ask what he's dreaming about <<if not flagged("a1_boomer_dream")>>
    Boomer: Waffles... the possum ones... from the Union...
    Boomer: Doreen only makes them for the possum... why can't I be the possum...
    Dex: The Union is off the main quad. If I could get one of those waffles...
    <<flag a1_boomer_dream>>
    <<jump A1_Boomer_Menu>>
-> Ask him to move aside <<if not flagged("a1_boomer_moved")>>
    Boomer: Can't. Guarding the records. From the bad music. Hut, hut. Hike.
    <<jump A1_Boomer_Menu>>
-> Wake him up
    Dex: Gil said he cries for an hour and then eats a lamp. I like lamps. I'll let him sleep.
    <<jump A1_Boomer_Menu>>
-> Tiptoe away
    Boomer: (snore) Hhhnnnk... good game... hhhnnnk...
===
title: A1_Boomer_GiveWaffle
---
Dex: I wave the possum waffle under his nose.
Boomer: (sniff) ...sniff... POSSUM.
Dex: He takes the waffle, turns around with his eyes still shut, and shuffles out the door, chewing.
Dex: He's heading for the lounge. Sleepwalking with a snack. Good for you, big guy. The crate is free.
<<take possum_waffle>>
<<flag a1_boomer_moved>>
===
title: A1_Boomer_GiveAlarm
---
Dex: Ring an alarm clock in a sleepwalker's ear? Gil said he cries for an hour. I'm not starting that.
===

title: Vending_Look
---
Dex: Snacks, socks, and earplugs. Dorm life essentials.
===
title: Vending_Use
---
<<if has("earplugs") or flagged("gil_has_earplugs")>>
    Dex: I don't need anything else from the machine of dreams.
<<elseif not has("dollar")>>
    Dex: Earplugs, two for a dollar. I'm a dollar short. Story of my life.
<<else>>
    Dex: One crumpled dollar in, two earplugs out. The future is now.
    <<take dollar>>
    <<give earplugs>>
<<endif>>
===

title: DrinksTable_Look
---
Dex: A recipe card: "Hallway Hooch. Lemon plus soda, served with confidence."
===
title: DrinksTable_Use
---
<<if flagged("made_hooch") or flagged("lacey_has_drink")>>
    Dex: The table's picked clean.
<<elseif not has("lemon") and not flagged("a1_took_lemon")>>
    Dex: One lemon, slightly used.
    <<give lemon>>
    <<flag a1_took_lemon>>
<<elseif not has("soda")>>
    Dex: The soda's all gone. Just empty cans and one sad straw. Somebody had a powerful thirst.
    Dex: The Student Union on the quad has a soda fountain. That's my best bet.
    <<flag a1_saw_no_soda>>
<<else>>
    Dex: I have what I need. Lemon, meet soda.
<<endif>>
===
title: Combine_Lemon_Soda
---
Dex: Lemon in the soda. Hallway Hooch, served with confidence.
<<take lemon>>
<<take soda>>
<<give hallway_hooch>>
<<flag made_hooch>>
===

title: Item_earplugs_Look
---
Dex: Foam earplugs. Sweet, sweet silence.
===
title: Item_dance_album_Look
---
Dex: Hank Hollister, live at the Grand Ole Barn. Pure heartbreak on vinyl.
===
title: Item_lemon_Look
---
Dex: A lemon. Lightly bruised, like my ego.
===
title: Item_soda_Look
---
Dex: Lemon-lime soda, ice cold, from Doreen's secret cooler. Or is it lime-lemon?
===
title: Item_hallway_hooch_Look
---
Dex: Hallway Hooch. Smells like confidence and regret.
===
title: Item_cowboy_hat_Look
---
Dex: Lacey Rae's hat. Proof that tonight is going my way.
===
title: Item_pine_freshener_Look
---
Dex: A pine tree air freshener. "Alpine Morning." It has seen things in room 216.
===
title: Item_boomer_alarm_Look
---
Dex: Boomer's alarm clock. Two bells, one setting: LOUD. Perfect for making a scene somewhere quiet.
===

title: Stairs_Look
---
Dex: The stairwell. Down to the main campus, and the rest of my life.
===
title: Stairs_Use
---
<<go campus from_dorm>>
===
